天和闻星既在现代购物、也在古代过上了幸福的生活。","series_id":"7456828118087502873","episode":true,"vertical":true,"content_type":1,"recommend_info":"{\"channel_id\":\"94349560332\",\"request_id\":\"202611062356341A17241E3FC1309376EC\",\"rank\":\"2\",\"queue_names\":\"shortplay\",\"final_queue_name\":\"heji\",\"gid\":\"7456828118087502873\",\"plan_id\":\"1\",\"is_show_ad_flag\":\"0\",\"series_pred_score\":\"{\\\"absolute_staytime\\\":0.1658162623643875,\\\"stream_ctr\\\":0.04188840091228485,\\\"staytime_stream\\\":1.3754295110702515,\\\"finish\\\":0.03732689097523689,\\\"like\\\":0.06278920918703079,\\\"collect\\\":0.04535258188843727,\\\"normalized_duration\\\":1.0307363271713257}\"}","recommend_group_id":"7456828118087502873","play_cnt":11424,"book_exist":false,"copyright":"贰拾叁楼短剧","sub_title":"逆袭·奇幻脑洞","score":"8.3","use_video_model":true,"episode_cnt":61,"video_platform":3,"disable_play":false,"category_schema":"[{\"category_id\":5031,\"name\":\"逆袭\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5031&categoryName=逆袭&genreType=130&gender=1&source=detail\"},{\"category_id\":5074,\"name\":\"奇幻脑洞\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5074&categoryName=奇幻脑洞&genreType=130&gender=1&source=detail\"},{\"category_id\":5123,\"name\":\"穿越\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5123&categoryName=穿越&genreType=130&gender=1&source=detail\"},{\"category_id\":5124,\"name\":\"时空对话\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5124&categoryName=时空对话&genreType=130&gender=1&source=detail\"},{\"category_id\":5175,\"name\":\"打脸反派\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5175&categoryName=打脸反派&genreType=130&gender=1&source=detail\"},{\"category_id\":5224,\"name\":\"大男主\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5224&categoryName=大男主&genreType=130&gender=1&source=detail\"},{\"category_id\":5312,\"name\":\"架空\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5312&categoryName=架空&genreType=130&gender=1&source=detail\"},{\"category_id\":5339,