=pzVKrHmkn%2FLGiTCc%2FoLo2CLupAQ%3D","duration":7241,"title":"蔷薇花谢即归来","video_desc":"沈家庶女沈蔷薇因不愿被继母卖给恶霸为妾，带着小妹投奔京城名门之首姨母张氏，惨遭被拒，为求生路，私下里勾引萧晏清，得以以表姑娘的名义留在萧府。白日，两人是恪守礼节的表兄妹，夜里，两人暧昧厮磨。沈蔷薇本想等萧晏清娶妻后便悄然离开，不曾想外表看似克己复礼的萧晏清，内心腹黑偏执，对她满是占有欲，执意要纳她为妾。本剧改编自番茄小说《疯批权臣夺她，是你先勾我的》，作者-笑语晏晏。","series_id":"7510194759202245694","episode":true,"vertical":true,"content_type":1,"recommend_info":"{\"channel_id\":\"94349560332\",\"request_id\":\"202611062356341A17241E3FC1309376EC\",\"rank\":\"9\",\"queue_names\":\"shortplay\",\"final_queue_name\":\"heji\",\"gid\":\"7510194759202245694\",\"plan_id\":\"1\",\"is_show_ad_flag\":\"0\",\"series_pred_score\":\"{\\\"absolute_staytime\\\":0.22842152416706085,\\\"collect\\\":0.06278920918703079,\\\"stream_ctr\\\":0.046894099563360214,\\\"normalized_duration\\\":1.166837215423584,\\\"like\\\":0.07263670861721039,\\\"staytime_stream\\\":1.4190025329589844,\\\"finish\\\":0.04535258188843727}\"}","recommend_group_id":"7510194759202245694","play_cnt":626648,"book_exist":false,"copyright":"快创短剧","sub_title":"爱情·古风爱情","score":"8.2","use_video_model":true,"episode_cnt":83,"video_platform":3,"disable_play":false,"category_schema":"[{\"category_id\":5000,\"name\":\"爱情\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5000&categoryName=爱情&genreType=130&gender=0&source=detail\"},{\"category_id\":5051,\"name\":\"古风爱情\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5051&categoryName=古风爱情&genreType=130&gender=0&source=detail\"},{\"category_id\":5104,\"name\":\"日久生情\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5104&categoryName=日久生情&genreType=130&gender=0&source=detail\"},{\"category_id\":5091,\"name\":\"暧昧拉扯\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5091&categoryName=暧昧拉扯&genreType=130&gender=0&source=detail\"},{\"category_id\":5178,\"name\":\"逆风翻盘\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5178&categoryName=逆风翻盘&genreType=130&gender=0&source=detail\"},{\"category_id\":5324,\"name\":\"腹黑\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySear